ter%27s_Wrath\" title=\"Item:Epic Winter&#39;s Wrath\">Epic Winter's Wrath</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Polar_Ray\" title=\"Polar Ray\">Polar Ray</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Polar_Ray\" title=\"Polar Ray\">Polar Ray</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 30<br /><b>Charges: </b>15 (15/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 15 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:15)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Glaciation\" title=\"Glaciation\">Glaciation +146</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Glaciation\" title=\"Glaciation\">Glaciation +146</a>:</b> Passive: +146 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Cold <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Ice Lore +21%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Ice Lore +21</a>:</b> Passive: Your Cold spells gain a +21% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wand_Maximizing\" title=\"Wand Maximizing\">Wand Maximizing</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wand_Maximizing\" title=\"Wand Maximizing\">Wand Maximizing</a>:</b> Spells cast from this wand are treated as though they were Maximized, dealing 100% more damage than they normally would. This damage increase does not stack with bonuses granted by enhancements.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Legendary_Winter%27s_Wrath.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Legendary_Winter%27s_Wrath.png/420px-Legendary_Winter%27s_Wrath.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"595\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Legendary_Winter%27s_Wrath.png 1.5x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<p>Not upgradeable \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><i>A thin rod of blackened wood containing charges of the Polar Ray spell. Eternal wands recharge over time if they are not actively being used.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">Recharges at a rate of 1 charge per 30 seconds\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817221601\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.082 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2457/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17819/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5566/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   66.682      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   66.682      1 -total\n 95.74%   63.844      1 Template:Eternal_wand\n 41.12%   27.422      5 Template:Popup\n 34.10%   22.736      1 Template:Mat\n 12.97%    8.648      1 Template:Spelllore\n 11.48%    7.653      1 Template:SpellPower\n 10.28%    6.852      1 Template:BgColorVar\n 10.25%    6.832     32 Template:IO\n  8.51%    5.678      1 Template:Bind\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:95322-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817221601 and revision id 633191. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
